OL,3,GNEWSABody found in woodland confirmed  
OL,4,Aas missing Kelsey Hunter               
OL,6,FPolice have confirmed that a body found
OL,7,Fin woodland in southern Scotland has   
OL,8,Fbeen identified as missing 20-year-old 
OL,9,FKelsey Hunter.                         
OL,11,FShe had last been seen in Castle       
OL,12,FDouglas at 17:00 on Saturday and a     
OL,13,Fmajor search was carried out around the
OL,14,Fnearby village of Springholm where she 
OL,15,Flived.                                 
OL,17,FOn Tuesday, Daniel McKnight, 21,       
OL,18,Fappeared on petition at Dumfries       
OL,19,FSheriff Court charged with murder and  
OL,20,Ftwo other charges, including defeating 
OL,21,Fthe ends of justice. Kelsey's body was 
OL,22,Ffound at about 19:15 on Wednesday.     
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
